    "description": {
      "value": "Built from the taxidermic body of a basilisk, a petrification cannon functions as a +2 greater striking double-barreled musket. A petrification cannon can be activated to fire a beam of energy that transforms flesh into stone.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Traits:** magical, transmutation\n\nFrequency once per hour Effect A beam of coiling energy leaps from the petrification cannon at a target within 60 feet. The target must attempt a Fortitude save against DC 34 with the effects of flesh to stone."
